Channel gorgias-drafts
Far ":gorgias-remote:[Gmail]/Drafts"
Near ":gorgias-local:Drafts"
CopyArrivalDate yes
Create Both
Expunge Both
SyncState *

Group gorgias
Channel gorgias-inbox
Channel gorgias-trash
Channel gorgias-spam
